1  | P(b)
2  | ((a=b) ∨ Q) → ¬P(a)
   |----
3  | | b=a
   | |----
4  | | b=b                       = Intro
5  | | a=b                       = Elim: 4, 3
6  | | (a=b) ∨ Q                 ∨ Intro: 5
7  | | ¬P(a)                     → Elim: 2,6
8  | | P(a)                      = Elim: 1, 3
9  | | ⊥                         ⊥ Intro: 8, 7
10 | ¬(b=a)                      ¬ Intro: 3-9
